[{"name":"JS runtimes (reusable)","on":{"workflow_call":{"inputs":{"working-directory":{"description":"Directory holding package.json","type":"string","default":"."}}}},"permissions":{"contents":"read"},"jobs":{"provision":{"name":"provision","runs-on":"ubuntu-latest","timeout-minutes":15,"steps":[{"name":"Checkout caller repository","uses":"actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1","with":{"persist-credentials":false}},{"name":"Checkout standards for the checker","uses":"actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1","with":{"repository":"metadatastician/standards","ref":"${{ job.workflow_sha }}","path":".standards-js","persist-credentials":false,"sparse-checkout":"tools/js-runtimes\n","sparse-checkout-cone-mode":false}},{"name":"Build js-runtimes","run":"set -euo pipefail\ncargo install --quiet --locked --path .standards-js/tools/js-runtimes --root \"$RUNNER_TEMP/jsr\"\nrm -rf .standards-js\n"},{"name":"Environment definitions provision Bun first","env":{"WORKDIR":"${{ inputs.working-directory }}"},"run":"\"$RUNNER_TEMP/jsr/bin/js-runtimes\" provision \"$WORKDIR\""}]},"check":{"name":"${{ matrix.runtime }}","runs-on":"ubuntu-latest","timeout-minutes":20,"strategy":{"fail-fast":false,"matrix":{"runtime":["bun","deno","pnpm"]}},"env":{"PNPM_PIN":"pnpm@10.28.0+sha512.05df71d1421f21399e053fde567cea34d446fa02c76571441bfc1c7956e98e363088982d940465fd34480d4d90a0668bc12362f8aa88000a64e83d0b0e47be48"},"steps":[{"name":"Checkout caller repository","uses":"actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1","with":{"persist-credentials":false}},{"name":"Is there a package.json?","id":"has","env":{"WORKDIR":"${{ inputs.working-directory }}","RUNTIME":"${{ matrix.runtime }}"},"run":"if [ -f \"$WORKDIR/package.json\" ]; then\n  echo \"pkg=true\" >> \"$GITHUB_OUTPUT\"\nelse\n  echo \"pkg=false\" >> \"$GITHUB_OUTPUT\"\n  echo \"::notice::No package.json in '$WORKDIR': 0 JavaScript manifests, nothing for the $RUNTIME leg to check.\"\nfi\n"},{"na